{"id": "SkillString_STR_SKILL_PC_ELEMENTALIST_16800001_skill_desc_effect", "source": "Has a {abe:1680000011:value02:divide100}% chance to deal <chat_combat>{se_dmg:1680000111:SkillUIMinDmgsum}-{se_dmg:1680000111:SkillUIMaxDmgsum}</> extra damage on landing an attack on a target that is taking Damage over Time.\n\nCooldown: 1s", "translation": "Ma {abe:1680000011:value02:divide100}% szansy na zadanie dodatkowych obrażeń <chat_combat>{se_dmg:1680000111:SkillUIMinDmgsum}-{se_dmg:1680000111:SkillUIMaxDmgsum}</> celowi objętemu obrażeniami rozłożonymi w czasie, gdy trafia go atak.\n\nCzas odnowienia: 1 s", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "SkillString_STR_SKILL_PC_ELEMENTALIST_16800001_skill_name", "source": "Consecutive Countercurrent", "translation": "Seryjny kontratak", "status": "draft"}
